// Title: Lolbin Unregmp2.exe Use As Proxy
// Sigma ID: 727454c0-d851-48b0-8b89-385611ab0704
// Status: test | Level: medium
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2022-12-29 | Modified: 2024-06-04
// ATT&CK: stealth, T1218
// Description: Detect usage of the "unregmp2.exe" binary as a proxy to launch a custom version of
//   "wmpnscfg.exe"
// False positives:
//   - Unknown
// References:
//   - https://lolbas-project.github.io/lolbas/Binaries/Unregmp2/
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/05d1031f537e830b76da53bae2400c5814c89165/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_lolbin_unregmp2.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, microsoft_xdr schema)

DeviceProcessEvents
| where (FolderPath endswith "\\unregmp2.exe" or ProcessVersionInfoOriginalFileName =~ "unregmp2.exe") and (ProcessCommandLine contains " -HideWMP" or ProcessCommandLine contains " /HideWMP" or ProcessCommandLine contains " –HideWMP" or ProcessCommandLine contains " —HideWMP" or ProcessCommandLine contains " ―HideWMP")
